<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11 trln rbls in bills Mar 19.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11 trln rbls in bills Mar 19.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will offer seven trillion roubles of 301-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22077) and four trillion roubles of 175-day T-bills (series 22076) on March 19, the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:  </p>
<p>Full details of the 301-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		    22077</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     7.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			 March 19, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				301 day</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    Jan 14, 1998</p>
<p>Full details of the 175-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		    22076</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			 March 19, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				175 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    Sept 10, 1997</p>
<p>On March 19 the Finance Ministry will also repay about 6.63 trillion roubles in maturing six-month T-bills (series 22045).</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
